@startuml ws-01-pis-sct-redirect
' WS-01 — single SEPA credit transfer, redirect SCA, confirmation on the enrolled device.
' PROPOSAL generated by AI from SRC-IG §5.1.1, §5.3.1, §5.4 and SRC-ADR.
' The gap in the middle is the point of this diagram: nothing shows the PSU what is being paid.
title WS-01 — SEPA credit transfer (redirect, device confirmation) — with the gap Q-17 leaves

actor "PSU" as psu
participant "PISP" as tpp
participant "Finologee" as fin
participant "XS2A adapter" as edge
participant "Payment\n(CMP-PAYMENT)" as pay
participant "Authorisation" as auth
participant "PSU channel" as psuapi
participant "Transmit CIAM" as ciam
participant "Bank app" as app
participant "Core adapter\n(CMP-CORE-ADAPTER)" as core
participant "PingFederate" as ping
participant "DCP" as dcp

psu -> tpp : pay by bank
tpp -> fin : POST /v1/payments/sepa-credit-transfers
fin -> edge : forward identified request
edge -> pay : create payment initiation (RCVD)
pay -> auth : start authorisation implicitly
auth --> tpp : 201 Created + scaRedirect

tpp --> psu : redirect to scaRedirect
psu -> ciam : bank login screen (SCR-CIAM-LOGIN)
ciam -> psuapi : resolveRedirectSession
psu -> ciam : authenticates
ciam -> app : ask an enrolled device to confirm
app -> psuapi : getScaPrompt
psu -> app : confirms identity (SCR-APP-OTP / SCR-APP-BIOMETRIC)

note over app, psuapi #FFDDDD
  GAP (Q-17, C-09). SRC-ADR names a consent confirmation
  panel and nothing for a payment, so no surface shows the
  amount and the payee. getPaymentApproval exists and is
  marked x-conditional-on: Q-17; nothing calls it.
  Dynamic linking has nothing to bind to (INV-AUT-05).
end note

app -> ciam : SCA result
ciam -> psuapi : recordScaResult
psuapi -> auth : record
auth -> pay : authorisation finalised (EVT-PAYMENT-AUTHORISED)
pay -> core : submit the payment
core -> ping : exchange the CIAM token for a PingFederate token (D-02)
ping --> core : PingFederate token
core -> dcp : submit, with a PingFederate token
dcp --> core : accepted
pay -> pay : transactionStatus ACTC
ciam --> psu : outcome page and back to the TPP

tpp -> fin : GET .../status
fin --> tpp : transactionStatus ACTC
@enduml
